The alternative — a steward plan covering R1000 alone — delivers a formatting function with nothing printing, drops one of OD-1's two mandated halves, and is the horizontal slice the Planning rule forbids. The oracle's own handoff anticipated this and recommended the other shape: fold R1000 into the `convert` milestone plan, with a standalone steward plan legal only *"if the milestone plan has already been cut."* It has not been.

